    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d742">

                <pb facs="1280" n="1233" xml:id="pg1233"/>

                <head>742. Telegram 453 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d742-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-11-01">November 1, 1956, 10
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d742-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d742-1"/>
                <p>453. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>No repeat no reply yet from Wang. Am
                    departing for Prague this morning. Have aranged to keep in touch en route with
                    Osborn who will keep Department informed of developments.</p>
                <p>Drafts requested papers going forward today’s pouch.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
